cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Mae Hong Son Loop"
message: "If you use the curve counts, the demand windows or the air summaries, please cite this."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "NaN"
    website: "https://wichaa.net"
url: "https://nanobotco.github.io/mae-hong-son-loop/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A bilingual (English and Thai) route guide and directory for the Mae Hong Son motorcycle
  loop in northern Thailand. Includes an original curve-density measurement of six Thai
  highways computed from OpenStreetMap geometry at four angular thresholds, a per-2 km
  riding-demand map, and four burning seasons of daily PM2.5 at ten points on the circuit.
  Road geometry and harvested places are ODbL 1.0, © OpenStreetMap contributors.
keywords:
  - Mae Hong Son
  - Thailand
  - motorcycle touring
  - OpenStreetMap
  - road geometry
  - PM2.5
  - air quality
